      "shortCode": "DWRnMAhgXev",
      "caption": "Follow @thewizeai to stay ahead with AI\n\nThis startup lets you order sunlight from space to your exact location in 30 seconds. And it costs less than renting a generator \u2600\ufe0f\n\nReflect Orbital launched mirrors into space. Small satellites that rotate to reflect sunlight wherever you need it on earth. Open an app, drop a pin, sunlight arrives in under 30 seconds. A couple thousand dollars an hour.\n\nNo trucks. No equipment. No setup. Just light from space delivered like an Uber.\n\nBut here\u2019s where AI makes this possible. Coordinating thousands of tiny mirrors across orbit, calculating angles in real-time, tracking locations on a spinning planet, adjusting for atmosphere and weather. That\u2019s not human math. That\u2019s AI running continuous orbital mechanics at scale.\n\nFilm sets that needed $50K lighting rigs now order space light for a fraction. Disaster zones without power get illumination instantly. Events, construction sites, search and rescue. Anywhere darkness is a problem, sunlight becomes a service.\n\nWe went from \u201charness the sun\u201d being a metaphor to literally redirecting sunlight on demand via smartphone. AI made space infrastructure feel like ordering coffee.\n\nFollow @thewizeai for more AI insights\n\n#ReflectOrbital #AI #space #sunlight #climatetech",
