      "caption": "Follow @thewizeai to stay ahead with AI\n\nAnthropic CEO on the 2 things he refuses to let the Pentagon use Claude for. And it reveals what \u201clawful use\u201d actually means \ud83c\udfaf\n\nThe Pentagon wants \u201call lawful use\u201d of Claude. Sounds reasonable until you understand what lawful means: anything Congress hasn\u2019t explicitly banned yet.\n\nMass surveillance isn\u2019t illegal. Private companies collect your data, sell it to the government, and AI analyzes millions of people at once. No warrant needed. Technically lawful because the law hasn\u2019t caught up to the technology.\n\nAutonomous weapons that fire without human decision aren\u2019t illegal either. We haven\u2019t written that law yet. So \u201clawful use\u201d includes weapons that choose targets and kill without a person in the loop.\n\nThis is the trick of \u201clawful use\u201d demands. It doesn\u2019t mean ethical. It doesn\u2019t mean safe. It means: if Congress hasn\u2019t banned it yet, we want AI enabled for it. And AI moves faster than Congress writes laws.\n\nDario\u2019s drawing a line that the law won\u2019t. Because by the time something becomes illegal, it\u2019s already been deployed.\n\nFollow @thewizeai for more AI insights\n\n#Anthropic #Pentagon #AI #surveillance #autonomousweapons",
